{"c":[{"name":"20261003T054535Z-cd383e079c08d5e3","text":"Host: KeyType's FocusedFieldSnapshot.caretRect is AppKit (bottom-left); the gate, surfaces and perch need FocusedFieldSnapshot.caretRectAX, or the gate tests a mirrored point and holds ghost text as covered.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T054535Z-f725bb7f07997327","text":"fill_acceptance popup needs the reader started with --act-pids: the executor writes through reader verbs, and without it the run stops with notAllowed and the host shows 'The form changed'.","type":"note"}]}
